---
kind: quest
id: east.quests
title: Eastmarch side quests
---

// OWNED BY east. Every quest is tier="run" (AREAS.md §8). Who hands them out:
//   eastMeridianPassengers  starts when Kai has been met on the Meridian
//   eastLanterns            Yun the lantern-maker, Ashgrove (complete="any")
//   eastGardens             Poppy the florist, Bloomfield; its two errands are
//                           activate="accept" children (Poppy, Beekeeper Tom)
//   eastPowerOutage         the Monster Center board (accept="external")
//   eastThunderwing         Keeper Sol at the Portvolt lighthouse, at night

// ── The Meridian: beat every passenger who wants a battle ────────────────
<quest id="eastMeridianPassengers" title="Every passenger aboard" start="visited('east.ferryRival')">
  <objective id="crew" title="Beat the two sailors" done="holds('defeated', ['meridianSailorBram']) && holds('defeated', ['meridianSailorOona'])"/>
  <objective id="guests" title="Beat the four guests" done="holds('defeated', ['meridianGentlemanHale']) && holds('defeated', ['meridianLassPip']) && holds('defeated', ['meridianFisherTeo']) && holds('defeated', ['meridianBeautyCeline'])"/>
  <reward kind="MONEY" amount="2000"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @meridianSteward: Every passenger on the Meridian, beaten fair and square. The captain has asked me to present you with the ship's compliments, and something more practical.
  </on>
</quest>

// ── Ashgrove: a lantern for the tower (either way closes it) ─────────────
<quest id="eastLanterns" title="A lantern for Ash Tower" complete="any">
  <objective id="night" title="Walk with the lanterns on a Friday night" done="visited('east.lanternNight')"/>
  <objective id="ghost" title="Or bring Yun a ghost to carry the light" on="talk" target="npc.ashgroveLanternMaker" done="holds('caughtType', ['ghost'])"/>
  <reward kind="ITEM" amount="1" target="spellTag"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @ashgroveLanternMaker: There. Now there's a light up there that's yours. Take this; it was my mother's. Ghosts like it. Well. Some ghosts.
  </on>
</quest>

// ── Bloomfield: Poppy's gardens (two errands, taken up separately) ───────
<quest id="eastGardens" title="Bloomfield's gardens">
  <objective id="seeds" title="Deliver Poppy's seeds" quest="eastGardensSeeds"/>
  <objective id="bees" title="Find Tom's hive a new queen" quest="eastGardensBees"/>
  <reward kind="ITEM" amount="1" target="miracleSeed"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @bloomfieldFlorist{vo}: Seeds in Portvolt, a queen in the hive. Bloomfield will be in bloom by Sunday. You've earned this: it grows anything.
  </on>
</quest>

<quest id="eastGardensSeeds" title="Seeds for the Portvolt market" activate="accept">
  <objective id="deliver" title="Take the seed packets to Marta in Portvolt" on="talk" target="npc.portvoltVendor" done="true"/>
  <reward kind="MONEY" amount="500"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @portvoltVendor: Poppy's seeds! Finally something on my stall people want. Here, for your trouble. Tell her the striped awning says thank you.
  </on>
</quest>

<quest id="eastGardensBees" title="A new queen for the hive" activate="accept">
  <objective id="queen" title="Show Tom a waspire" on="talk" target="npc.bloomfieldBeekeeper" done="holds('caught', ['waspire'])"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @bloomfieldBeekeeper: A waspire! Look at her. The hive'll follow her anywhere. Don't worry, she'll still be yours. They just like to know she's about.
  </on>
</quest>

// ── The board: Portvolt's flickering lights ──────────────────────────────
<quest id="eastPowerOutage" title="Board: Portvolt's lights keep flickering" accept="external">
  <objective id="plant" title="Find the old power plant down Route 8" done="visited('east.powerPlant')"/>
  <objective id="tamsin" title="Get past the council's engineer" done="holds('defeated', ['powerPlantEngineerTamsin'])"/>
  <reward kind="MONEY" amount="3000"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @narrator: The council's note on the Center board has been stamped PAID. Somebody has drawn a small lightning bird in the corner.
  </on>
</quest>

// ── Keeper Sol's storm bird ──────────────────────────────────────────────
<quest id="eastThunderwing" title="The storm bird">
  <objective id="catch" title="Find what sits on the power plant's chimney" done="holds('caught', ['thunderwing'])"/>
  <on event="questComplete">
    @portvoltKeeper{vo}: So it was real. I'll sleep tonight, for the first time in forty years.
  </on>
</quest>
